• TOXIC RP: ay 7aja li ghat9der t9ala9 chakhss li mora perso (khassatan TREBRIB = 2 DAYS --> 4 DAYS BAN ).
• GIRLS RP: ila khssrat m3ak deriya lhedra t9der tkhassar m3aha lhedra machi f nafss level (ex: gatlik SIR T7WA ! goliha SIRI ALLAH IN3AL MOK ! XD ) PERMA BAN.
• GIRLS RP 2: interdit t3anab 3la chi deriya ila ignoratek, interdit tkhassar lhedra m3a deriya ila makantich kat3refha RP + HRP fiha PERMA BAN.
• Need an admin? Do /report in-game ila kenti mgeltchi , si non dir ticket and 7ote fiha clip dial report (NVL , TOXIC ...)
• You must clip at least Les clips khasshoum ikouno kaybeyno la situation kamla with VOICE and MIC dialek.
• Report : Report ida daz 3la mochkil 1Week mabin wa9t dyalo o waqt d report = Report Annule.
• Ila te7ti f chi fight ma3ndksh l7a9 trje3 lih (cooldown 30min  obligatoire) NO RESPECT COOLDOWN 2 DAYS.
• Metagaming : Tjib Des Infos HRP w tb9hom f RP (ex: tjib information man discord, annoucement, stream, OOC...) 2 DAYS MIN.
• Powergaming : It's allowed. (situation RP semi strict ).
• Carkill : tdkhel f chi wahd b véhicule t9tlo . (bl3ani, ila machi bl3ani khassek trpiha) 4 DAYS MIN.
• Freekill : t9tel chi wahd Bla ta reason valable li tsstahal lmoute. obligatoire tkoun l moute hiya akhire solution 3andek from 2 DAYS to 4 DAYS
• NVL : Ay scene wla action fiha (No value of Life) khassek tkhaf 3la 7yatak b7al real life man ay 7aja kathadad l7ayat dialak. (taser madakhalch f NVL) 4 DAYS MIN.
• /Me t9dr t’usiha ONLY bach twssaf ay 7aja li you can not do it m3a script / animation. ay usage akhour = BAN. (interdis dirha o nta taya7) 2 DAYS.
• Abuse salaire : Interdit 3la Chi wahd yhez Duty w howa Off service Fiha Ban. (mechanic outside had rule) 7 DAYS / INE9SSO LIK FLOUSS 3LA 7SSAB LES ADMINS.
• Acting as Admin : t couvri 3la rassek b rules wst RP (ma dirch fiha admin), khali bnadem ighlate o it7amal mass2ouliya dialo sans provocation 2 DAYS MIN.
• ALT To ALT : T3ti items , infos … b perso dyalk 9bl madir bih mort rp o takhdhom b new character mn b3d (PERMA BAN). ay tranfer item, money man 2nd perso 3liha PERMA BAN.
• Out of character : Maktbqach dwi b perso dyalek d rp ktkhroj elih o katrja3 kthdar nichan b perso dyalek real. 2 DAYS MIN.
• Win RP : Hiyaa Tbghi Gha trba7 w Dir li fjahdak Gha bach trba7 sa7a. (2 days).
• Refuse/Force Rp : you can refuse RP BUT you can not refuse rp with : POLICE, MEDIC, or anyone who you already started a scean with. 2 DAYS.
• Afk : ila kanti AFK f server t7amal mass2ouliya dialak, matjich tbki 3la les Admins.
• Fairplay : Tkon kat9abal lkhassara o tkoune clean fach trba7.
• Mass Rp : Streets D les gangs /comico  4 Gangster max y9Adro ypushiwe  but gang lakhra / police ki defendiwe kamline.  (ban 48h)
• Mass Rp 2: police tab3inek o rja3ti l street dialak maghadich idekhlo mais ay la7da i9ad idekhlo 3likoum SWAT. Gangs tab3ine police bach iherbo s7abhoum et police dekhlo comico gangs can attack comico (4 max) 
• Cohérence RP : Obligatoire trespecti backstory dialk w tb9a cohérente (Ex : matmchiche against logic dial perso dialak, LEGAL=LEGAL) WHITLISTE REVOKED.
• Mix RP : tkhlet mabin RP w HRP (Les admins makayt7amloch mass2ouliya dial chi 7aja outside server.) 2 DAYS MIN.
• (ALT F4) : mamno3 dire ALT+f4 ila mchat lik connexion ola pc crash 3andek 5 min bach trja3 tkemel scean dialak ila ma9dertich,sifet msg l Admin, OR dire ticket dire fih record or screenshot kibayan lwe9t o lmochkile 7 DAYS.
• 2 JOBS: Teqdar takhdem f khedma wa7da machi jouj (exp: tkoun khadam medic o khadam 7ta f mechanic, INTERDIT) 7 DAYS.
• CANCEL ANIMATION : Interdit dire l chi animation cancel b chi emotes. (ex: nta katrobi o katchta7 or nta miyet o dire animation bach t7bess rob ... ) 7 DAYS.
• Abuse script: mamnou3 dire chi 7aja li script kat7mik biha .
• 2nd/3rd perso slot: cas par cas ghadi t7al ticket.
• INSULTING A DOWNED PLAYER : 2 DAYS.
• Destructive speech : Avoid racism, politics, trolling, deep HRP problems and any other destructive speech (ex: N word and discriminatory language with reference to a person or a group on the basis of who they are, in other words, based on their religion, ethnicity, nationality, colour, descent, gender or other identity factor is strictly prohibited.) 2 Weeks to PERMA BAN.

