• HOSTAGE: T9der thez ayi wahed hotage ONLY for  braquage a part medic "in duty" ( interdit tkhtef police bach ital9o lik s7abak, o ila khtafti police for other reasons t7amal mass2ouliya dialak) do not call any service bach ONLY tkhetfo. (BAN 48h)
• ESCORT : ma3endekch l7a9 t Escorti chi 7ed ou hoya miyet wakha tkoun nta li taye7tih. ila kan taya7 f chi blassa ROBIH SUR PLACE , ila kane f chi CAR , te9dar tkharjo menha -  2 DAYS.
• NO MEMORY VOICE : mamknch lik t3ref chi wa7ed ONLY b sawt dialo. 

